{"t":"HII","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":46000,"hq":"Newport News, VA, United States","website":"https://www.hii.com","summary_en":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc. designs, builds, overhauls, and repairs military ships in the United States. It operates through three segments: Ingalls, Newport News, and Mission Technologies. The company is involved in the design and construction of non-nuclear ships comprising amphibious assault ships, surface combatants, and national security cutters for the U.S. Navy and U.S. Coast Guard. It also provides nuclear-powered ships, such as aircraft carriers and submarines, as well as refueling and overhaul, and inactivation services of nuclear-powered aircraft carriers. In addition, the company offers naval nuclear support services, including fleet services comprising design, construction, maintenance, and disposal activities for in-service the U.S. Navy nuclear ships; and maintenance services on nuclear reactor prototypes. Further, the company provides C5ISR systems and operations; application of artificial intelligence and machine learning to battlefield decisions; defensive and offensive cyberspace strategies and electronic warfare; uncrewed autonomous systems; live, virtual, and constructive solutions; platform modernization; and critical nuclear operations. The company has a strategic partnership with HD Hyundai Heavy Industries to implement intelligent mechanized welding systems at Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.'s Ingalls Shipbuilding division. Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc. was founded in 1886 and is headquartered in Newport News, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.는 미국에서 군함을 설계, 제작, 점검 및 수리합니다. Ingalls, Newport News 및 Mission Technologies의 세 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 미국 해군과 미국 해안경비대를 위한 상륙 강습함, 수상 전투함, 국가 안보 정찰함으로 구성된 비핵 선박의 설계 및 건조에 참여하고 있습니다. 또한 항공모함, 잠수함 등 원자력 추진 선박뿐만 아니라 원자력 항공모함의 재급유, 정비, 비활성화 서비스도 제공합니다. 또한 이 회사는 미 해군 핵 선박의 설계, 건설, 유지 보수 및 폐기 활동으로 구성된 함대 서비스를 포함하여 해군 핵 지원 서비스를 제공합니다. 원자로 프로토타입에 대한 유지보수 서비스. 또한 회사는 C5ISR 시스템 및 운영을 제공합니다. 전장 결정에 인공 지능 및 기계 학습 적용; 방어적이고 공격적인 사이버 공간 전략과 전자전; 무인 자율 시스템; 라이브, 가상 및 건설적인 솔루션; 플랫폼 현대화; 그리고 중요한 핵 작전. 이 회사는 Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.의 Ingalls 조선 부문에 지능형 기계화 용접 시스템을 구현하기 위해 HD 현대중공업과 전략적 파트너십을 맺었습니다. Huntington Ingalls Industries, Inc.는 1886년에 설립되었으며 버지니아 주 뉴포트 뉴스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":289.41,"mcap":11404508160.0,"pe":15.584815,"fpe":14.152383,"peg":0.9078,"ps":0.8429052,"pb":2.0765438,"ev_ebitda":11.238,"div":1.95,"beta":0.147,"hi52":460.0,"lo52":255.36},"fin":{"rev":13530000384.0,"rev_g":0.108,"eps_g":0.489,"gross":0.1272,"op":0.07718,"net":0.054180004,"roe":0.13994001,"fcf":193375008.0,"cash":387000000.0,"debt":2928999936.0,"de":53.332,"eps":18.57,"feps":20.44956},"own":{"short":0.0458,"inst":0.92767996,"insider":0.0047299997},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":362.58334,"median":364.5,"high":406.0,"low":281.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":2.08333,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":5,"hold":6,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":375.0,"priorPriceTarget":370.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":352.0,"priorPriceTarget":304.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-14","Firm":"Bernstein","ToGrade":"Market Perform","FromGrade":"Market Perform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":304.0,"priorPriceTarget":327.0},{"Grade